WEBVTT

00:11:59.298 --> 00:12:02.217
Do you want your name
to be remembered long after you're gone?

00:12:03.302 --> 00:12:08.474
The Hi Level mindset is about doing
everything that you put your hands on

00:12:08.515 --> 00:12:11.018
at the highest level
that you're capable of doing.

00:12:13.103 --> 00:12:15.230
Think of your life as a book.

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:19.234
Again, each chapter
isn't going to be perfect.

00:12:20.027 --> 00:12:22.404
But how do you want your story to end?

00:12:22.404 --> 00:12:23.655
In anguish?

00:12:24.406 --> 00:12:25.908
A bunch of what-ifs?

00:12:26.533 --> 00:12:27.826
Or leaving a legacy?

00:12:29.161 --> 00:12:30.412
I choose legacy.